{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The village and the forest lived together in harmony, until the day the corruption started.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit a band of merry villagers, wander into the forest and set things right again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If your band fails, recruit another one! and another one, and another... and so on until things are\u00a0<i>right</i>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What you'll find in the forest</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn-based one-press gameplay</strong><br>Moving and attacking happens in one go - both for you and for the enemy. Tactical positioning is key to success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832200/extras/8fa582667b43c39ec0aa716d6ab093a9.apng?t=1756874329\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832200/extras/8fa582667b43c39ec0aa716d6ab093a9.poster.avif?t=1756874329\" class=\"bb_img\" width=390 height=255 /></picture></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Telegraphed enemy attacks</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll know exactly what (most) enemies will do on their turn. Hope this helps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832200/extras/00eb94d478348d77aed58965f32b2cf0.apng?t=1756874329\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832200/extras/00eb94d478348d77aed58965f32b2cf0.poster.avif?t=1756874329\" class=\"bb_img\" width=420 height=330 /></picture></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recruit and upgrade</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each battle, you'll be able to spend coins on upgrades and new recruits. One more Scarecrow unit, or Double hit for your Archer?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832200/extras/8ad95902c9041fddc64424d390e6a5dc.avif?t=1756874329\" width=509 height=224 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Varied squad composition</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run allows you to try new combinations of units and skills from a large pool of possibilities. 28 recruitable units and over 130 different upgrade types means there's more than one way to cut a tree.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special events</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The forest is deep and contains many mysteries - some good, some bad, some weird!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832200/extras/208fc3dbe6980f9d838f500b77197583.apng?t=1756874329\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832200/extras/208fc3dbe6980f9d838f500b77197583.poster.avif?t=1756874329\" class=\"bb_img\" width=315 height=240 /></picture></span></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3832200?t=1756874329","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3832200?t=1756874329","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832200/7be8e9b87f875725d792b0cb2fe6eacf54ab665e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756874329","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832200/7be8e9b87f875725d792b0cb2fe6eacf54ab665e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756874329","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The village and the forest lived together in harmony, until the day the corruption started.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit a band of merry villagers, wander into the forest and set things right again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If your band fails, recruit another one! and another one, and another... and so on until things are\u00a0<i>right</i>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What you'll find in the forest</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn-based one-press gameplay</strong><br>Moving and attacking happens in one go - both for you and for the enemy. Tactical positioning is key to success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832200/extras/8fa582667b43c39ec0aa716d6ab093a9.apng?t=1756874329\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832200/extras/8fa582667b43c39ec0aa716d6ab093a9.poster.avif?t=1756874329\" class=\"bb_img\" width=390 height=255 /></picture></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Telegraphed enemy attacks</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll know exactly what (most) enemies will do on their turn. Hope this helps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832200/extras/00eb94d478348d77aed58965f32b2cf0.apng?t=1756874329\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832200/extras/00eb94d478348d77aed58965f32b2cf0.poster.avif?t=1756874329\" class=\"bb_img\" width=420 height=330 /></picture></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recruit and upgrade</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each battle, you'll be able to spend coins on upgrades and new recruits. One more Scarecrow unit, or Double hit for your Archer?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832200/extras/8ad95902c9041fddc64424d390e6a5dc.avif?t=1756874329\" width=509 height=224 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Varied squad composition</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run allows you to try new combinations of units and skills from a large pool of possibilities. 28 recruitable units and over 130 different upgrade types means there's more than one way to cut a tree.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special events</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The forest is deep and contains many mysteries - some good, some bad, some weird!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832200/extras/208fc3dbe6980f9d838f500b77197583.apng?t=1756874329\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832200/extras/208fc3dbe6980f9d838f500b77197583.poster.avif?t=1756874329\" class=\"bb_img\" width=315 height=240 /></picture></span></p></li></ul>","developers":["Jens Arvidsson"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832200/18d7ea0ab9edbe7b3f7ce9cc5c2b41ccea3b0348/header.jpg?t=1756874329","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Any that can run a .NET 6.0 runtime<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Must support OpenGL 2.1 or higher.<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 12.0+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicon or Intel<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>St